Summary of modifications since the upstream baseline
-----------------------------------------------------
- Renamed the project and product from MacEverything to MacSoSo. This includes
  the Xcode project/targets/schemes, source and test directories, app and MCP
  binaries, bundle identifier (com.macsoso.app), cache/log paths, MCP server
  key, DMG names, and documentation. Upstream attribution is preserved.
- Search syntax and matching semantics aligned with voidtools Everything:
  OR precedence, <> grouping, quoting, wildcard/path rules, filters,
  functions, modifiers, date filters, aggregate/duplicate filters, sorting.
- Everything-style desktop UI: four-column result table, column sorting,
  persistent search-option toggles, bottom status bar, full result set.
- DirectoryScanner now includes local user volumes under /Volumes (APFS,
  HFS, exFAT, FAT, NTFS, UDF, ISO) while still skipping network, autofs,
  system and hidden mounts.
- Flat index format bumped to v2 so caches created before external-volume
  support are invalidated and rebuilt automatically.
- Added reproducible release packaging (bundled re2/abseil dylibs, DMG,
  checksums) and a GitHub Actions tag-release workflow.

Detailed change notes: docs/CHANGES_FROM_UPSTREAM.md

